	What game are *you* playing? :)
	In nethack, one doesn't #sacrifice, one #offers. Sacrifice is
traditionally the killing of someone or something for a god, maybe on an 
altar. Bloodletting, whatever. In nethack, you're offering tokens of 
your alignment - monsters you've already killed, albeit in your god's name.
	Offerings are a whole different tradition.
	#offering non-co-aligned monsters is just a way of showing your god
that you're serving it.
